 "Sprayed with seaweed": "Rociado con algas marinas",
 "Saving picks it here, and it is on the list from now on. Removing it later keeps every {one} already recorded under it, and keeps this name on them.": "Al guardar se elige aquí, y queda en la lista de ahora en adelante. Si lo quitas después, cada {one} ya registrado con él se queda, y conserva este nombre.",
 "Saving picks it here, and it is on the list from now on. Removing it later asks where to move the {many} recorded under it, and deletes none of that.": "Al guardar se elige aquí, y queda en la lista de ahora en adelante. Si lo quitas después, te pregunta a dónde mover {many} registrados con él, y no borra nada de eso.",
 "{subject} recorded under {name}. Pick what to move it to; nothing is deleted.": "{subject} registrado con {name}. Elige a qué moverlo; no se borra nada.",
